  "claim": "For the octahedral knot sphere's NAE formula NAE(K_k): (1) with a variable for each corner's agreement (a 2-XOR of its points) defined by four clauses, cutting planes refutes it with O(n) lines, every line giving sum of its corner atoms <= 1, every face >= 1, and their sums contradicting by F - L = 2; (2) under every assignment every line has 1 or 3 agreeing corners and every face an odd number, so every corner parity holds and the contradiction is the integer fact that a satisfied line has one agreeing corner, invisible modulo 2; over the points alone the linear relaxation is feasible at x = 1/2.",
